{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_t006gym01_gym_01",
      "hash": "2e794eb10bfeff6b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "等你很久喽！\\n未来的冠军！\\c\\n道馆馆主马志士少校是个\\n能将电属性宝可梦\\r\\n运用自如的硬汉子！\\c\\n飞行属性和水属性\\n可能不太好对付他喔！\\c\\n你可要小心，\\n不要被电麻痹了！\\c\\n还有，马志士做事极为谨慎，\\n想要接近他可没那么容易呐！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_t006gym01_gym_02",
      "hash": "2e794fb10bff011e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "呼……！\\c\\n这场炫酷的比赛精彩得\\n简直让人头晕眼花啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_t006gym01_statue_01",
      "hash": "dd9408e725ee8ef6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "枯叶市宝可梦道馆\\n马志士认证训练家！\\r\\n[VAR TRNAME(0001)]"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_t006gym01_statue_02",
      "hash": "dd9407e725ee8d43",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "枯叶市宝可梦道馆\\n马志士认证训练家！\\r\\n[VAR TRNAME(0001)]　[VAR TRNAME(0000)]"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_t006gym01_gomi_01",
      "hash": "c6622a2b2c72f4ce",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我翻我翻……！\\n垃圾箱里只有垃圾！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_t006gym01_gomi_02",
      "hash": "c662292b2c72f31b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我翻我翻……！\\n嘿哟！垃圾箱底\\r\\n有一个开关！\\c\\n按一下试试吧！\\n……啪嗒！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_t006gym01_gomi_05",
      "hash": "c6622e2b2c72fb9a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "电击屏障\\n第１道锁已被解除！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_t006gym01_gomi_03",
      "hash": "c662282b2c72f168",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "电击屏障\\n第２道锁已被解除！\\c\\n电击屏障已经完全被解除了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_t006gym01_gomi_04",
      "hash": "c6622f2b2c72fd4d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "啊！\\n电击屏障又上锁了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_t006gym01_gomi_06",
      "hash": "c6622d2b2c72f9e7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "是红色的垃圾箱！"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_t006gym01_gomi_07",
      "hash": "c6622c2b2c72f834",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "是蓝色的垃圾箱！"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_t006gym01_gomi_08",
      "hash": "c662232b2c72e8e9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "这个垃圾箱的开关\\n已经被按下去了。"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_t006gym01_max",
